cff-version: 1.2.0
title: udon2godot
message: >-
  A fork placed in the Weftspun goal manifest at a pinned commit. It translates
  UdonSharp C# to SafeGDScript for the Godot sandbox; the teacher's Udon trait
  runs its translations as constructed fixture inputs, never as a data source.
